\toprule
Situation & Primary Action Type & Budget Multiplier & Urgency Score & Channel \\ \midrule
Exploration & Educational content & 0.8$\times$ & Low & SEARCH \\
Consideration & Comparative content, testimonials & 1.2$\times$ & Medium &
